Bindings para a engine Raylib (jogos 2D/3D):

```lumina
import "std/raylib"

InitWindow(800, 600, "Meu Jogo")
while WindowShouldClose() == 0:
    BeginDrawing()
    ClearBackground(BLACK)
    DrawText("Olá", 10, 10, 20, RAYWHITE)
